# aether-recovery.package — recovery services and the recovery menu/environment.
name: aether-recovery
version_from: VERSION
recipe: packaging/PKGBUILD-aether-recovery
license: GPL-3.0-only
source:
  - recovery
installs_to:
  /usr/libexec/aether/recovery: recovery/
  /usr/bin/aether-recovery: wrapper -> recovery/ui/recovery_menu.py
entry: recovery target (system/targets/aether-recovery.target) or menu app
provides:
  - boot/service diagnostics + redacted bundles (recovery/diagnostics)
  - repairs: bootloader, initramfs, package db, runtime config, IntentFS index (recovery/repair)
  - known-good rollback (recovery/rollback)
depends: [python]
